# Build context for sync/Dockerfile is now the REPO ROOT (Stage 1 of the
# Cloud Run consolidation, 2026-08-08 — see sync/Dockerfile's top comment).
# This repo has a lot in it (chatbot/, docs/, mockup/jobs/*.html, .git/,
# venvs, node_modules-scale illustration sources); deny-all + explicit
# allow-list keeps the upload small and makes "does the image need this?"
# an explicit yes rather than an accidental include.
#
# Docker requires every ancestor directory of an allowed path to also be
# un-ignored (BuildKit quirk) — hence the `!sync/` / `!mockup/` lines above
# their children.
*

!sync/
!sync/pyproject.toml
!sync/uv.lock
!sync/src/
!sync/src/**

!mockup/
!mockup/assets/
!mockup/assets/**
!mockup/index.html
